{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Echo Paradox is a psychological horror game where you explore alternate universes each with different haunting entities. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A TALE OF HUMANITY'S DARKEST DISCOVERY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/e4f79d7107769e7355188987b4d679b4.poster.avif?t=1751373334\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/e4f79d7107769e7355188987b4d679b4.webm?t=1751373334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/e4f79d7107769e7355188987b4d679b4.mp4?t=1751373334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Humanity stands on the brink of an unsettling revelation \u2013 the multiverse is real, but eerily devoid of life. As a daring volunteer for the Phaselink research group, you embark on a chilling journey, venturing into unknown parallel universes in a desperate quest to find any remnants of human existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW WILL YOU SURVIVE?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for a descent into terror. The further you explore, the more the fabric of reality warps around you. Each universe is a twisted reflection of our own, haunted by entities that defy explanation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/139c58d14c7d7193bbfda1134d947c08.poster.avif?t=1751373334\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/139c58d14c7d7193bbfda1134d947c08.webm?t=1751373334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/139c58d14c7d7193bbfda1134d947c08.mp4?t=1751373334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONFRONT THE PARADOX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Echo Paradox&quot; challenges not just your courage but your perception. Puzzles and clues are woven into the very essence of each reality, demanding keen observation and problem-solving skills. Facing the enigmatic entities of these parallel worlds, you must unravel the paradox of their existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/fdf53a3908397d7ce3f2b0c4ae066000.poster.avif?t=1751373334\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/fdf53a3908397d7ce3f2b0c4ae066000.webm?t=1751373334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/fdf53a3908397d7ce3f2b0c4ae066000.mp4?t=1751373334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WE ARE NOT ALONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their intentions are unknown, and their presence is a constant reminder that in these abandoned worlds, you are the intruder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/9a25065030e9eaeb1b836482fbd26cff.poster.avif?t=1751373334\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/9a25065030e9eaeb1b836482fbd26cff.webm?t=1751373334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/9a25065030e9eaeb1b836482fbd26cff.mp4?t=1751373334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiverse Exploration: Traverse through alternate universes with unique haunting entities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological Horror Elements: Immerse in a psychologically intense atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Puzzles and Challenges: Solve intricate puzzles in ever-changing alternate realities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Sound Design: Experience haunting soundscapes and spine-chilling ambient noises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Orientation Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2743410/e2b0e393fba42db424a39defef28998f949358dd.jpg"},{"name":"Close Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2743410/44391e0b2eaf50da0371179f5cdf910d97e18674.jpg"},{"name":"Mother of Worlds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2743410/64525449eb3cf117bdbf44141c7bf1c2d125f521.jpg"},{"name":"No Clipping","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2743410/33241562fb9bb6a9e0c6f164a28063545a87d973.jpg"},{"name":"The First Expedition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2743410/018656c9abd3da2bb76835416eb56c641a200f82.jpg"},{"name":"Final Volunteers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2743410/c5cc8838ce8bc74957b0d90b027c675c59761d6a.jpg"},{"name":"You were never meant to see this","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2743410/6204d35a006ad642dbeccd40285799d7d881103d.jpg"},{"name":"Burn the Witch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2743410/2c0301548c61e4b7e86cfc4f0d4eca581bec576c.jpg"},{"name":"Naughty List","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2743410/985d6f7c73d036439241e670482f7114d5c6aefd.jpg"},{"name":"End of the Line","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2743410/cf9f5c58b06e5617ed761d7e50658fc276676cf2.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2743410?t=1751373334","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751373334","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751373334","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751373334","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Echo Paradox is a psychological horror game where you explore alternate universes each with different haunting entities. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A TALE OF HUMANITY'S DARKEST DISCOVERY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/e4f79d7107769e7355188987b4d679b4.poster.avif?t=1751373334\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/e4f79d7107769e7355188987b4d679b4.webm?t=1751373334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/e4f79d7107769e7355188987b4d679b4.mp4?t=1751373334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Humanity stands on the brink of an unsettling revelation \u2013 the multiverse is real, but eerily devoid of life. As a daring volunteer for the Phaselink research group, you embark on a chilling journey, venturing into unknown parallel universes in a desperate quest to find any remnants of human existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW WILL YOU SURVIVE?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for a descent into terror. The further you explore, the more the fabric of reality warps around you. Each universe is a twisted reflection of our own, haunted by entities that defy explanation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/139c58d14c7d7193bbfda1134d947c08.poster.avif?t=1751373334\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/139c58d14c7d7193bbfda1134d947c08.webm?t=1751373334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/139c58d14c7d7193bbfda1134d947c08.mp4?t=1751373334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONFRONT THE PARADOX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Echo Paradox&quot; challenges not just your courage but your perception. Puzzles and clues are woven into the very essence of each reality, demanding keen observation and problem-solving skills. Facing the enigmatic entities of these parallel worlds, you must unravel the paradox of their existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743410/extras/fdf53a3908397d7ce3f2b0c